ce, sand, dots, and more!\n\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Please note: This is a hand-tracked 20-minute experience. Want more? Simply scan a new environment. Each new environment creates a fresh experience as the worlds adapt to your space.\n\nCreated by the award-winning XR studio, Metanaut.", "short_description": "Wonder is an anthology of beautiful experiments in delight and wonder. Discover three stunning experiences that bring magic to your everyday space. Perfect for newcomers and VR enthusiasts looking for a moment of calm wonder.\n\nJourney through:\n\u2022 Ancient Ruins \n\u2022 Jellyfish Bloom\n\u2022 Parallel Worlds\n\nCreated by the award-winning XR studio, Metanaut."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://metanautlabs.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Metanaut", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://metanautlabs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9825970260764408"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1082030570628221"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4020746058211084"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "986549946783694"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "621975087120646"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "584194944636166"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1332216817979948"}, {"status":